gin-right:6px;' alt=''/&gt;&lt;b&gt;G-HUMAN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style='background:#16a34a; color:#ffffff; font-size:9px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:3px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:0.3px; margin-left:6px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle;'&gt;IMPLEMENTADO · E3/E4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;div style='margin-top:6px; line-height:1.45;'&gt;&lt;span style='color:#d97706; font-weight:bold; font-size:10px;'&gt;HIGH&lt;/span&gt; · Revisión humana registrada y firmas de aprobación&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;shadow=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1625" y="587" width="295" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="page-6-operations_c31" value="&lt;img src='data:image/svg+xml;base64,' width='16' height='16' style='vertical-align:-2px; margin-right:6px;' alt=''/&gt;&lt;b&gt;G-ROLES&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style='background:#16a34a; color:#ffffff; font-size:9px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:3px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:0.3px; margin-left:6px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle;'&gt;IMPLEMENTADO · E3/E4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;div style='margin-top:6px; line-height:1.45;'&gt;&lt;span style='color:#2563eb; font-weight:bold; font-size:10px;'&gt;MEDIUM&lt;/span&gt; · Registro de roles válido y permisos por función&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;shadow=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="679" width="295" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="page-7-target" name="7. Arquitectura Objetivo (Target Architecture)"><mxGraphModel dx="2100" dy="740" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2100" pageHeight="740" math="0" shadow="1"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="page-7-target_c1" value="&lt;img src='data:image/svg+xml;base64,' width='18' height='18' style='vertical-align:-2px; margin-right:6px;' alt=''/&gt; &lt;b&gt;ARQUITECTURA OBJETIVO: CANONICAL RUN, EVENT MODEL &amp;amp; EVIDENCE GRAPH (ADR-0009, ADR-0010, ADR-0011)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:11px; color:#cbd5e1;'&gt;Fronteras de confianza explícitas · Flujo desacoplado de eventos · Grafo de evidencia criptográfico · Telemetría OTel&lt;/span&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#0f172a;strokeColor=#1e293b;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="25" width="2000" height="60" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="page-7-target_c2" value="TB-0: FRONTERA DEL OPERADOR Y SUPERVISOR HOST (Privilegiado, No Accesible por LLM)" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=4;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#0284c7;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;fontColor=#475569;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="95" width="460" height="580" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="page-7-target_c3" value="TB-1: PROCESO DEL AGENTE SUPERVISADO (Código Terceros, Confinado)" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=4;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#d97706;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;fontColor=#475569;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="550" y="95" width="460" height="580" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="page-7-target_c4" value="TB-2: PLANO DE HERRAMIENTAS &amp;amp; SERVIDORES MCP (Subprocesos Aislados)" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=4;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#e11d48;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;fontColor=#475569;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1050" y="95" width="460" height="580" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="page-7-target_c5" value="TB-3: ALMACÉN DE EVIDENCIA &amp;amp; POLÍTICAS (Inmutable, Append-Only)" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=4;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#16a34a;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;fontColor=#475569;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1550" y="95" width="500" height="580" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="page-7-target_c6" value="&lt;img src='data:image/svg+xml;base64,' width='16' height='16' style='vertical-align:-2px; margin-right:6px;' alt=''/&gt;&lt;b&gt;SUPERVISOR DE CORRIDA (Run Supervisor)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style='background:#4f46e5; color:#ffffff; font-size:9px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:3px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:0.3px; margin-left:6px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle;'&gt;PLANIFICADO · E0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;div style='margin-top:6px; line-height:1.45;'&gt;• Genera &lt;code&gt;run_id&lt;/code&gt; unívoco (UUIDv4/ULID).&lt;br/&gt;• Asigna secuencia monótona &lt;code&gt;seq&lt;/code&gt; a eventos.&lt;br/&gt;• Gestiona máquina de estados formal:&lt;br/&gt;  &lt;code&gt;INIT&lt;/code&gt; ➔ &lt;code&gt;GUARD_ON&lt;/code&gt; ➔ &lt;code&gt;EXEC&lt;/code&gt; ➔ &lt;code&gt;EVAL&lt;/code&gt; ➔ &lt;code&gt;DONE&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;• Orquesta timeouts y señales de proceso.&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0284c7;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;shadow=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="140" width="420" height="155" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="page-7-target_c7" value="&lt;img src='data:image/svg+xml;base64,' width='16' height='16' style='vertical-align:-2px; margin-right:6px;' alt=''/&gt;&lt;b&gt;COMPILADOR DE POLÍTICA Y SONDAS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style='background:#16a34a; color:#ffffff; font-size:9px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:3px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:0.3px; margin-left:6px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle;'&gt;IMPLEMENTADO · E3/E4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;div style='margin-top:6px; line-height:1.45;'&gt;• Lee &lt;code&gt;policy.json&lt;/code&gt; (Única Fuente de Verdad).&lt;br/&gt;• Compila a esquemas nativos sin tocar el agente.&lt;br/&gt;• Ejecuta sondas en frío para verificar ejecutabilidad.&lt;br/&gt;• Aplica RBAC y perfiles de gobierno de flota.&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0284c7;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;shadow=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="320" width="420" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="page-7-target_c8" value="&lt;img src='data:image/svg+xml;base64,' width='16' height='16' style='vertical-align:-2px; margin-right:6px;' alt=''/&gt;&lt;b&gt;CANAL DE APROBACIÓN HUMANA (Escalation)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style='background:#16a34a; color:#ffffff; font-size:9px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:3px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:0.3px; margin-left:6px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle;'&gt;IMPLEMENTADO · E3/E4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;div style='margin-top:6px; line-height:1.45;'&gt;• Interrupción interactiva ante reglas &lt;code&gt;ASK&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;• Confirmación explícita para comandos sensibles.&lt;br/&gt;• Emite token de aprobación firmado para la sesión.&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0284c7;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;shadow=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="495" width="420" height="140" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="page-7-target_c9" value="&lt;img src='data:image/svg+xml;base64,' width='16' height='16' style='vertical-align:-2px; margin-right:6px;' alt=''/&gt;&lt;b&gt;RUNTIME DEL AGENTE (LLM Context)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style='background:#475569; color:#ffffff; font-size:9px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:3px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:0.3px; margin-left:6px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle;'&gt;EXTERNO / TERCEROS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;div style='margin-top:6px; line-height:1.45;'&gt;• Instancia de agente (Claude, Kiro, Antigravity, Gemini).&lt;br/&gt;• Mantiene contexto conversacional y razonamiento.&lt;br/&gt;• Despacha llamadas a herramientas por stdio/RPC.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;i style='color:#be123c;'&gt;Sin acceso a secretos ni a políticas del juez&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d97706;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;shadow=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="570" y="140" width="420" height="155" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="page-7-target_c10" value="&lt;img src='data:image/svg+xml;base64,' width='16' height='16' style='vertical-align:-2px; margin-right:6px;' alt=''/&gt;&lt;b&gt;MAPEJADOR CANÓNICO DE EVENTOS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style='background:#4f46e5; color:#ffffff; font-size:9px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:3px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:0.3px; margin-left:6px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle;'&gt;PLANIFICADO · E0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;div style='margin-top:6px; line-height:1.45;'&gt;• Captura streams nativos (stream-json, ACP, stdout).&lt;br/&gt;• Transforma a &lt;code&gt;CanonicalEvent&lt;/code&gt; estructurado:&lt;br/&gt;  - &lt;code&gt;run_id&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;seq&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;timestamp&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;event_type&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;  - &lt;code&gt;actor&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;payload&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;verdict&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;• Puente compatible con spans de OpenTelemetry (OTel).&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d97706;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;shadow=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="570" y="320" width="420" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="page-7-target_c11" value="&lt;img src='data:image/svg+xml;base64,' width='16' height='16' style='vertical-align:-2px; margin-right:6px;' alt=''/&gt;&lt;b&gt;MOTOR DE REPLAY FORENSE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style='background:#4f46e5; color:#ffffff; font-size:9px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:3px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:0.3px; margin-left:6px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle;'&gt;PLANIFICADO · E0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;div style='margin-top:6px; line-height:1.45;'&gt;• Reproduce fielmente corridas pasadas desde diario.&lt;br/&gt;• Diagnostica alucinaciones o derivas de comportamiento.&lt;br/&gt;• Compara salidas entre distintas versiones de modelos.&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d97706;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;shadow=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="570" y="495" width="420" height="140" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="page-7-target_c12" value="&lt;img src='data:image/svg+xml;base64,' width='16' height='16' style='vertical-align:-2px; margin-right:6px;' alt=''/&gt;&lt;b&gt;GUARDIÁN PRE-HERRAMIENTA (Dynamic Guard)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style='background:#16a34a; color:#ffffff; font-size:9px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:3px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:0.3px; margin-left:6px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle;'&gt;IMPLEMENTADO · E3/E4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;div style='margin-top:6px; line-height:1.45;'&gt;• Interceptor síncrono &lt;code&gt;PreToolUse&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;• Valida rutas canónicas resueltas con &lt;code&gt;realpath&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;• Bloquea lectura/escritura en &lt;code&gt;protected_paths&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;• Redacta 9 familias de credenciales en memoria.&lt;br/&gt;• Emite veredicto síncrono: &lt;code&gt;ALLOW&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;DENY&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;ASK&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e11d48;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;shadow=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1070" y="140" width="420" height="155" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="page-7-target_c13" value="&lt;img src='data:image/svg+xml;base64,' width='16' height='16' style='vertical-align:-2px; margin-right:6px;' alt=''/&gt;&lt;b&gt;SERVIDORES MCP CONFINADOS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style='background:#475569; color:#ffffff; font-size:9px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:3px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:0.3px; margin-left:6px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle;'&gt;EXTERNO / TERCEROS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;div style='margin-top:6px; line-height:1.45;'&gt;• Procesos locales de herramientas (Playwright, Git, etc.).&lt;br/&gt;• Conexión mediante transporte stdio / JSON-RPC.&lt;br/&gt;• Ejecutan únicamente herramientas autorizadas en lockfile.&lt;br/&gt;• Restricción de permisos I/O gobernada por el sistema.&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e11d48;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;shadow=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1070" y="320" width="420" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="page-7-target_c14" value="&lt;img src='data:image/svg+xml;base64,' width='16' height='16' style='vertical-align:-2px; margin-right:6px;' alt=''/&gt;&lt;b&gt;SISTEMA DE ARCHIVOS DEL PROYECTO&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style='background:#475569; color:#ffffff; font-size:9px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:3px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:0.3px; margin-left:6px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle;'&gt;EXTERNO / TERCEROS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;div style='margin-top:6px; line-height:1.45;'&gt;• Árbol de código fuente gobernado.&lt;br/&gt;• Operaciones de lectura y edición autorizadas.&lt;br/&gt;• Protegido contra escrituras destructivas (&lt;code&gt;rm -rf&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e11d48;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;shadow=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1070" y="495" width="420" height="140" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="page-7-target_c15" value="&lt;img src='data:image/svg+xml;base64,' width='16' height='16' style='vertical-align:-2px; margin-right:6px;' alt=''/&gt;&lt;b&gt;DIARIO INMUTABLE DE EVENTOS (events.jsonl)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style='background:#4f46e5; color:#ffffff; font-size:9px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:3px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:0.3px; margin-left:6px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle;'&gt;PLANIFICADO · E0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;div style='margin-top:6px; line-height:1.45;'&gt;• Registro append-only en &lt;code&gt;.harness/runs/&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;• Persistencia síncrona con &lt;code&gt;fsync&lt;/code&gt; en hitos críticos.&lt;br/&gt;• Cada evento lleva hash y firma del supervisor.&lt;br/&gt;• Trazabilidad forense completa punto a punto.&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#16a34a;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;shadow=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1590" y="140" width="420" height="155" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="page-7-target_c16" value="&lt;img src='data:image/svg+xml;base64,' width='16' height='16' style='vertical-align:-2px; margin-right:6px;' alt=''/&gt;&lt;b&gt;GRAFO DE EVIDENCIA CRIPTOGRÁFICO&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style='background:#4f46e5; color:#ffffff; font-size:9px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:3px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:0.3px; margin-left:6px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle;'&gt;PLANIFICADO · E0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;div style='margin-top:6px; line-height:1.45;'&gt;• DAG de aserciones, artefactos y ejecuciones.&lt;br/&gt;• Nodos dirigidos: &lt;code&gt;AssertionNode&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;ArtifactNode&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;• Aristas causales: &lt;code&gt;VERIFIED_BY&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;REFUTES&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;• Huellas SHA-256 inmutables de código y outputs.&lt;br/&gt;• Prohíbe formalmente el paso por verdad vacía.&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#16a34a;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;shadow=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1590" y="320" width="420" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="page-7-target_c17" value="&lt;img src='data:image/svg+xml;base64,' width='16' height='16' style='vertical-align:-2px; margin-right:6px;' alt=''/&gt;&lt;b&gt;PLANO DE EVALUACIÓN FORMAL (Evaluation Plane)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style='background:#16a34a; color:#ffffff; font-size:9px; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:3px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:0.3px; margin-left:6px; display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle;'&gt;IMPLEMENTADO · E3/E4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;div style='margin-top:6px; line-height:1.45;'&gt;• Evaluador puro de las 13 puertas canónicas.&lt;br/&gt;• Emite veredicto inmutable &lt;code&gt;Result&lt;/code&gt; con 5 estados.&lt;br/&gt;• Invariante duro: &lt;code&gt;PASS&lt;/code&gt; con hallazgos es un error estructural.&lt;br/&gt;• Exporta ledger y reportes para auditoría en CI/CD.&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#16a34a;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;shadow=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1590" y="495" width="420" height="140" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="page-7-target_c18" value="Control Flow (Start)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#0284c7;strokeWidth=2.2;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#cbd5e1;spacing=4;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;exitX=1.0;exitY=0.5;entryX=0.0;entryY=0.5;" parent="1" source="page-7-target_c6" target="page-7-target_c9" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="page-7-target_c19" value="Interception (PreToolUse)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#e11d48;strokeWidth=2.2;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#cbd5e1;spacing=4;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;exitX=1.0;exitY=0.5;entryX=0.0;entryY=0.5;" parent="1" source="page-7-target_c9" target="page-7-target_c12" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="page-7-target_c20" value="Tool Call (Allowed)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#16a34a;strokeWidth=2.0;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#cbd5e1;spacing=4;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;exitX=0.5;exitY=1.0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.0;" parent="1" source="page-7-target_c12" target="page-7-target_c13" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="page-7-target_c21" value="I/O Disk" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#64748b;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#cbd5e1;spacing=4;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;exitX=0.5;exitY=1.0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.0;" parent="1" source="page-7-target_c13" target="page-7-target_c14" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="page-7-target_c22" value="Approval Flow (ASK)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#d97706;strokeWidth=2.0;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#cbd5e1;spacing=4;dashed=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;exitX=0.0;exitY=0.7;entryX=1.0;entryY=0.5;" parent="1" source="page-7-target_c12" target="page-7-target_c8" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1040" y="248" /><mxPoint x="1040" y="482" /><mxPoint x="530" y="482" /><mxPoint x="530" y="565" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="page-7-target_c23" value="Telemetry Stream" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#d97706;strokeWidth=2.0;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#cbd5e1;spacing=4;fontFamily=Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;exitX=0.5;exitY=1.0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.0;" parent="1" source="page-7-target_c9" t